{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0042_1000_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e34763f9ec6f1f540f35838a36b6aedf14c1c684c8024c0150bdce4816721ec7", "ja": "ふんふふ～ん♪　あ、{$P$}さん！\nおはようございます♪", "zh": "啦啦啦～♪啊，{$P$}先生！\n早安♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0042_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5007eb9a865d9b7366a7e42d5ea2c8e0ace6bbde7e0541a79ebf8f779e7611d6", "ja": "おはよう、風花。\n機嫌がいいみたいだけど、何かあったのか？", "zh": "早安，风花。\n我看你心情好像不错，有好事发生吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0042_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "18a263fa88ac1407c7910a84f3b11efe5533fc7032a29ff9ce32cd16193a526e", "ja": "はい！\n{$P$}さんのおかげですよ。", "zh": "是的！\n而且是{$P$}先生的功劳喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0042_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "cb12303059cdbcf8e6df879433580324323b025148c65055060c1c77b428b2a1", "ja": "お正月に、あんなかわいい着物を来て、\n神社で舞を奉納できるなんて……。", "zh": "让我在新年时可以穿上那么可爱的和服，\n在神社为神明献舞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0042_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "356efe0c233109dc538cedb196a9cf0da58214ebb80111a92c6e1b5f817eecde", "ja": "もう私、正統派アイドルって感じじゃないですか？\nふふふふふっ！", "zh": "这下我岂不就是正统派偶像了吗？\n呵呵呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0042_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e38b51be93964ae863974e390cc22b37c6fefb4038fc55c39cfd0215f1042cee", "ja": "ああ、うん。\nそうかもしれないな。", "zh": "原来是这样，嗯。\n或许吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0042_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4a5619bb8e809b77dda4bd8a87c437a7c5d0be46a4167cc2080c582d66600126", "ja": "なんだか、とっても嬉しくって……思わず、\n親戚の子たちにもお年玉奮発しちゃおうかなって。", "zh": "我真的觉得好开心……\n干脆今年包多一点压岁钱给亲戚小孩好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0042_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6deaa4b221df1e20deb92d16f0eece09e2be7ab4fd61d1bddd40eaff19e86ce9", "ja": "私、この調子で頑張ります！　これからも\nお願いしますね、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "我会继续保持下去！今后也请多多指教了，\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0042_1008_p", "source_sha256": "b604f5bccaadf7900e4cfdaeeb47e96c24b7a8367a4999ac3a6e74afa3fbc84d", "ja": "こちらこそ。よろしく、風花！", "zh": "彼此彼此，也请你多多指教了，风花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0042_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0042_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f6e8473cfe53df7850d881d789044b6dc12cf4eedcf37daff3849bf5d3eef330", "ja": "（『新春！　セクシーだらけの水着大運動会』から\nオファーが来ている話は、また今度にしよう……！）", "zh": "（其实我有拿到『新春！性感满点泳装大运动会』的\n工作邀约，但还是改天再告诉她吧……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
